[
    {
        "id": "csc14_tab",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "CSC14 telemetry",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "Pico W -> Mosquitto -> **this flow** -> PostgreSQL -> Grafana.\n\nRobot frames are compact binary (protocol v1, app_program/subsystem1/docs/MQTT_BINARY_PROTOCOL.md). The decoding, validation and storage code is in telemetry/lib and is loaded through global context `csc14` (telemetry/nodered/settings.js).\n\nThis flow only receives. It never publishes on csc14/cmd."
    },
